BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pickup question: Who did you play with at break today? What did yo
 u play?
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261228T151500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261228T153000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-after-school-questions-primary-2026-12-28-1@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Who did you play with at break today? What did you play?
 \n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: Who decided the rules?\n\nTIP: Give them 10 to 20 
 minutes and a snack before asking anything. Many children need time to dec
 ompress after school.\n\nSchool day 1 of 60 · Friends and people. On a sc
 hool holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Que
 stions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If your chi
 ld tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries ab
 out a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergenc
 y call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/893a07646724cbb9/
