DESCRIPTION:ASK: What was the best bit of today\, and the worst bit?\n\nIF
  YOU GET A SHRUG: Tell me more about the worst bit.\n\nTIP: Ask one questi
 on\, not five. Then wait. Count to five in your head before filling the si
 lence.\n\nSchool day 3 of 60 · Feelings. On a school holiday or INSET day
 \, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversa
 tion ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells you about bullyi
 ng or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, th
 e NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
